%% Admin Control Plane: Hot-Reload Configuration
%% Based on internal/config/runtime_optimizer_config.go
%% Updated: 2025-10-20 - Synchronized with codebase

sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant API as Admin API<br/>POST /admin/optimizer
    participant RuntimeConfig as RuntimeOptimizerConfig<br/>(Thread-Safe sync.RWMutex)
    participant InferHandler as InferHandler
    participant Req1 as Request N
    participant Req2 as Request N+1

    Note over A,Req2: Before: mode=ShadowModeShadow, sample_rate=0.01

    Req1->>InferHandler: POST /v1/infer
    InferHandler->>RuntimeConfig: GetMode()
    RuntimeConfig-->>InferHandler: ShadowModeShadow
    InferHandler->>InferHandler: Use InferenceRouter (primary)<br/>+ ShadowRunner (parallel)
    InferHandler-->>Req1: Response (Go result)

    A->>API: POST /admin/optimizer<br/>X-Admin-Token: secret<br/>{mode: "rust", sample_rate: 0.25}
    activate API

    API->>API: ValidateAdminToken()<br/>Check X-Admin-Token header

    API->>RuntimeConfig: SetMode("rust")
    activate RuntimeConfig
    RuntimeConfig->>RuntimeConfig: mu.Lock()<br/>mode = ShadowModeRust<br/>mu.Unlock()
    RuntimeConfig-->>API: OK
    deactivate RuntimeConfig

    API->>RuntimeConfig: SetSampleRate(0.25)
    activate RuntimeConfig
    RuntimeConfig->>RuntimeConfig: mu.Lock()<br/>sampleRate = 0.25<br/>mu.Unlock()
    RuntimeConfig-->>API: OK
    deactivate RuntimeConfig

    API-->>A: 200 OK<br/>{status: "ok", current_mode: "rust",<br/>sample_rate: 0.25, updated_at: "2025-10-20T..."}
    deactivate API

    Note over InferHandler: No restart required!<br/>Configuration updated in-memory<br/>Next request uses new settings

    Req2->>InferHandler: POST /v1/infer<br/>(next request, milliseconds later)
    InferHandler->>RuntimeConfig: GetMode()
    RuntimeConfig->>RuntimeConfig: mu.RLock()<br/>return mode<br/>mu.RUnlock()
    RuntimeConfig-->>InferHandler: ShadowModeRust
    InferHandler->>RuntimeConfig: GetSampleRate()
    RuntimeConfig-->>InferHandler: 0.25
    InferHandler->>InferHandler: rand() < 0.25<br/>Use Rust Optimizer<br/>(25% traffic)
    InferHandler-->>Req2: Response (Rust result)

    Note over A,Req2: After: mode=ShadowModeRust, sample_rate=0.25<br/>Applied instantly without deployment
